---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const updated = 'May 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — Signal Advisory" description="How Signal Advisory collects, uses, and protects information.">
  <Nav />

  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28">
    <p class="mb-5 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-stone">Last updated · {updated}</p>
    <h1 class="display text-4xl font-light leading-tight md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg mt-10 max-w-none text-ink/85">
      <p>
        Signal Advisory LLC ("Signal Advisory," "we," "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains
        what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have. We comply with applicable
        U.S. privacy and anti-spam laws including the CAN-SPAM Act.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display mt-10 text-2xl">Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact information you provide</strong> — name, business email, phone, company, job title — when you contact us, request information, or engage our services.</li>
        <li><strong>Business contact data from public and licensed sources</strong> — when we conduct outreach to prospective clients, we use information sourced from publicly available business directories and licensed B2B data providers (e.g., ZoomInfo).</li>
        <li><strong>Communication records</strong> — emails and messages exchanged with us, including replies and engagement metadata.</li>
        <li><strong>Website usage</strong> — basic analytics about how visitors use signaladvise.com.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="display mt-10 text-2xl">How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide and improve our advisory services.</li>
        <li>To communicate with you about your inquiry or engagement.</li>
        <li>To send relevant business outreach to professionals whose role and company suggest a fit with our services. Every outreach email includes a one-click unsubscribe.</li>
        <li>To maintain records required for legal, contractual, and tax purposes.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="display mt-10 text-2xl">How we share it</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with service providers who help us
        operate (e.g., email delivery, customer relationship management, scheduling) under appropriate
        confidentiality terms, or when required by law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display mt-10 text-2xl">Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Unsubscribe</strong> — every marketing email contains an unsubscribe link. One click removes you from future outreach.</li>
        <li><strong>Access, correction, deletion</strong> — request a copy of, correction to, or deletion of the personal information we hold about you by emailing us.</li>
        <li><strong>Do not contact</strong> — email us and we will permanently suppress your contact details from future outreach.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="display mt-10 text-2xl">Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use reasonable technical and administrative safeguards to protect personal information.
        No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display mt-10 text-2xl">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions or requests:
        <a href="mailto:info@signaladvise.com" class="text-signal underline">info@signaladvise.com</a>
        <br />
        Signal Advisory LLC · Kansas City, Missouri
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Base>
